<title>SINGAPORE: SINGAPORE 1ST-HALF 1997 CONSUMER INFLATION 1.7 PCT.</title>
<headline>SINGAPORE 1ST-HALF 1997 CONSUMER INFLATION 1.7 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore's consumer price inflation averaged 1.7 percent in the first half of 1997, the Department of Statistics said on Thursday.  </p>
<p>The department said in a statement the inflation rate in the first half of 1996 was 1.2 percent.</p>
